[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26820.07, "timestamp": "07:27:00", "text": "生命中一个特别的人等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26822.43, "timestamp": "07:27:02", "text": "通常都是情侣之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26826.23, "timestamp": "07:27:06", "text": "但我认为你应该庆祝它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26829.91, "timestamp": "07:27:09", "text": "与你的朋友、家人、爱人一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26833.11, "timestamp": "07:27:13", "text": "并非如此，它并不局限于此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26836.15, "timestamp": "07:27:16", "text": "亲人。好的？它可以采取以下形式："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26838.31, "timestamp": "07:27:18", "text": "庆典。你和他们一起玩，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26841.628, "timestamp": "07:27:21", "text": "好好享用晚餐，吃顿美餐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26845.11, "timestamp": "07:27:25", "text": "一起，一起出去，一起出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26848.43, "timestamp": "07:27:28", "text": "探索、旅行、旅游、观光、去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26853.03, "timestamp": "07:27:33", "text": "那些带有情人节元素的活动，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26855.03, "timestamp": "07:27:35", "text": "等等等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26865.948, "timestamp": "07:27:45", "text": "以上就是全部内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26872.75, "timestamp": "07:27:52", "text": "完毕。"}]